prompts.effects:
ONE transparent 8-column x4-row sprite atlas of 32 FLOOR OVERLAY frames for a classic Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup roguelike. Each cell intended as32x32 logical pixels; very coarse large hard square pixel blocks, simple flat colors, NO painted detail, no gradients, no glow fog, no text. The center of EVERY cell must be mostly transparent so floor, items and actors remain clearly visible. Thin segmented outlines or corner marks only, no filled tile backgrounds. Equal square cells, isolated with clear gutters. For EACH effect two adjacent frames: first restrained, second slight shift of2-3 bright pixel blocks, same bounds and palette. Order left-to-right top-to-bottom, two cells each:
1 WARNING: yellow hollow square corner brackets with a short yellow dash at edge;
2 URGENT: red hollow square corner brackets and red cross-shaped tiny edge sparks, distinctly different shape from warning;
3 SHRINE: soft pink four-corner sacred boundary marks and tiny white paper diamonds;
4 GARDEN: green vine corner arcs with two small red petal clusters;
5 WATER: cyan horizontal ripple arcs near lower and upper edges, clear middle;
6 GRAVITY: violet inward-pointing edge arrows and a thin broken dark-purple circle;
7 ORBIT: gold/lilac curved orbit segments on tile edges, one tiny planet dot;
8 FIRE: cyan-white ghost-fire wisps with curled lilac tips at tile corners, no red fire;
9 EXHIBIT: green/gold L-shaped display-frame corners;
10 SPOTLIGHT: pink-gold corner rays, tiny diamond lower edge;
11 FROST: pale blue corner frost crystals with simple3-pixel branches;
12 RHYTHM: purple alternating short beat bars on left and right edges;
13 SHIELD: silver/blue broken protective circle near edges;
14 SLIME: green irregular puddle edge at tile corners, no filled center;
15 IMPACT: white/gold sparse eight-direction strike rays with transparent center;
16 COMET: blue/cyan diagonal comet motion slashes near corners, tiny pale round spark.
Row1 pairs1-4, Row2 pairs5-8, Row3 pairs9-12, Row4 pairs13-16. Readability and transparent open center more important than decorative detail. Each outline2logicalpixels thick maximum. Sparse tiny retro game VFX drawn directly on tiny grid, NOT HD pixel illustrations. True transparent alpha entire backdrop.
